                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82b4d6a7-2798-3ef1-8654-d9112794b20f",
                        "entry_id": "7cf3ad10-7ca1-36d8-a572-59991638ad9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., книжн. красноречивый человек, оратор"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "82daa907-ab10-4973-ab50-e0c6eea4f196",
                                "sense_id": "82b4d6a7-2798-3ef1-8654-d9112794b20f",
                                "text": "Посмотреть бы московским столпам на надежду свою, поглядеть бы на витию, что всех умел убеждать, всех заставлял с собой соглашаться!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eecb49c8-12ff-4d2c-bc92-e39a83814f95",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cf3ad10-7ca1-36d8-a572-59991638ad9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "82b4d6a7-2798-3ef1-8654-d9112794b20f",
                        "target_lang_word": "orator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "orator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d2a0355-99c5-36f9-ab78-5782f89aed13",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf6856d-2d66-3acd-9f2d-ef3608b70024",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who orates or delivers an oration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0e49b65-8402-34d1-95ae-938e60ecb81a",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf6856d-2d66-3acd-9f2d-ef3608b70024",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A skilled and eloquent public speaker."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ec90e0a-f75c-44af-b96b-1cdf210f6a38",
                                                "sense_id": "a0e49b65-8402-34d1-95ae-938e60ecb81a",
                                                "text": "Tam[burlaine]. Then ſhall we fight couragiouſlye with them?\nOr looke you, I ſhould play the Orator?\nTech[elles]. No: cowards and faint-hearted runawaies,\nLooke for orations when the foe is neere.\nOur ſwordes shall play the Orators for vs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b49544-fbd3-4ca3-96c8-d0b3d3203f3c",
                                                "sense_id": "a0e49b65-8402-34d1-95ae-938e60ecb81a",
                                                "text": "[…] when it becomes obvious that I have not the slightest skill as a speaker – unless, of course, by skilful speaker they mean one who speaks the truth. If that is what they mean, I would agree that I am an orator, though not after their pattern."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b852169d-9f1c-3ecd-8d4e-6e9e76a07422",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf6856d-2d66-3acd-9f2d-ef3608b70024",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone sent to speak for someone else; an envoy, a messenger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51d2a415-a492-3523-b2c4-7528964b082e",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf6856d-2d66-3acd-9f2d-ef3608b70024",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A petitioner, a supplicant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee0f9bcb-859f-4f8d-9615-d6106915e96f",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cf3ad10-7ca1-36d8-a572-59991638ad9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "82b4d6a7-2798-3ef1-8654-d9112794b20f",
                        "target_lang_word": "talker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "talker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c073fa33-3be6-3ede-9d7f-2242b1185d74",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who talks, especially one who gives a speech, or is loquacious or garrulous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddb23b04-36c3-45da-8642-2c48435b8115",
                                                "sense_id": "c073fa33-3be6-3ede-9d7f-2242b1185d74",
                                                "text": "What this country needs is a smooth talker."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cc2a2f4-188c-4359-80f9-a0fa90ae8c02",
                                                "sense_id": "c073fa33-3be6-3ede-9d7f-2242b1185d74",
                                                "text": "That guy's a real talker."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03bcb323-0f26-4332-be35-c67eb252432a",
                                                "sense_id": "c073fa33-3be6-3ede-9d7f-2242b1185d74",
                                                "text": "Returning TED talker Sherry Turkle, an author and academic, says that giving lectures about how lonely the Internet is making people has made her and her audiences even lonelier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9133e26d-b271-4dc2-b4fc-e646cd792b73",
                                                "sense_id": "c073fa33-3be6-3ede-9d7f-2242b1185d74",
                                                "text": "At Iwo Jima, code talkers passed over 800 error-free messages in a 48-hour period, according to the Congressional law honoring the program."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfd57106-ae30-3996-95ba-63bbe96b5db3",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any creature or machine that talks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1c2b852-bc0c-4d7d-b73e-4563daaaa495",
                                                "sense_id": "bfd57106-ae30-3996-95ba-63bbe96b5db3",
                                                "text": "Some parrots are vociferous talkers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c07e0a17-607d-3ae4-bee9-57a14daa0292",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A talk show"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ce10287-0399-3aaa-a7d2-b186927ff6d2",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A talk-show host."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06601b67-269a-3eff-9910-049a7236a074",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An all-talk radio station."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "618cdb7f-addf-310c-87a4-7e2495e2763b",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A popular topic of conversation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d06ceae2-e53c-473f-84ed-af45615febc2",
                                                "sense_id": "618cdb7f-addf-310c-87a4-7e2495e2763b",
                                                "text": "The royal engagement is likely to be a top talker right through the wedding."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1de05c4-a5a8-36f1-abe1-7f1032edbbf9",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A talking point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b00f2192-b561-34e2-9ca3-afb0d1151bf6",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stripped-down version of a MUD which is designed for talking, predating instant messengers; a kind of early chat room."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02302fec-7a8e-3506-9726-2615dd7b89f9",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mouth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d67f1a10-5684-4261-914c-162bbc91fc77",
                                                "sense_id": "02302fec-7a8e-3506-9726-2615dd7b89f9",
                                                "text": "Although on Sundays when the men had finished feeding cattle, the rest of the afternoon was free […] still they weren't comfortable in the bunkhouse if George was abroad; he had a queer authority without even knowing it, an ability to upset you, maybe because he so seldom opened his talker and his silence made you look in upon yourself, on the guilt you always knew was there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed80d962-7399-3067-808c-75944f409743",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A table talker or shelf-talker."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba14426f-8b48-305f-96f6-9d9d090b02f5",
                                        "entry_id": "67555ce9-9dad-3e45-8c54-ad4b829a5486",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An augmentative and alternative communication device."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7fb1c6c-c5e1-4e52-b305-4bfbf3794782",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cf3ad10-7ca1-36d8-a572-59991638ad9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "82b4d6a7-2798-3ef1-8654-d9112794b20f",
                        "target_lang_word": "tribuno",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tribuno",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3027a635-b44a-3a16-b7da-c5dc9f1c5998",
                                        "entry_id": "c036f6db-e8dd-3176-8f4b-a1aae0ce825b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Orador político que es capaz de inspirar la acción popular mediante sus discursos apasionados."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Política"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b99a7580-1bbb-4475-bda7-d4adb9cd0926",
                                                "sense_id": "3027a635-b44a-3a16-b7da-c5dc9f1c5998",
                                                "text": "… Ahora, pues, ¿qué va Vd. a hacer con ese gaznápiro de su hijo, que no sirve por lo visto ni para un barrido ni para un fregado?\n-Un defensor de la libertad.\n-Un defensor de las musarañas.\n-Un tribuno.\n-¿Un tribuno? ¿Y qué es un tribuno?\n-El que defiende a capa y espada los derechos del pueblo.\n-Por vida de sanes, primo, que me dan ganas de volverle a Vd. las espaldas e irme. ¿No hay ya bastante de esa polilla sin ese zanguango más? Abra Vd. esos ojos, hombre de Dios, y mire si el pueblo quiere para nada semejantes tribunos. Mientras más tribunos más tiene que sudar, mire Vd. la gracia que le harán; que vaya a ver si ninguno del pueblo le da un maravedí para que vaya a tribunear por su cuenta. Farsa, primo, pura farsa; ¿qué ha sacado con eso?"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5d3c5d3-c1af-3d59-9168-0f094bbe87e1",
                                        "entry_id": "c036f6db-e8dd-3176-8f4b-a1aae0ce825b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Magistrado de la antigua Roma que era elegido por su tribu para representarla, con las facultades de vetar acciones del senado y de proponer plebiscitos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e20e53f-e9e1-4dd2-a5eb-87a57507ef59",
                                                "sense_id": "b5d3c5d3-c1af-3d59-9168-0f094bbe87e1",
                                                "text": "LELIO:\nEs indomable furor:\nno quiere estraño señor,\nni obedecen al Senado.\nAllá envían dos tribunos,\nyo pienso que voy con ellos."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ddda3a0-ff8e-4d5a-822e-80525b47c36e",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cf3ad10-7ca1-36d8-a572-59991638ad9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "82b4d6a7-2798-3ef1-8654-d9112794b20f",
